    (MIT, Bitstream Vera, OFL-1.1); emoji-icon-font by John Slegers (MIT).
  - symphonia, used unmodified under the Mozilla Public License 2.0.
  - Krilla, used through craft-pdf under MIT OR Apache-2.0, with its bundled Compact ICC
