Per-file authorship, sources and license texts are in the upstream ATTRIBUTION.md files and
must be preserved alongside the code that uses them.


Material that must not be carried over
======================================

The ArtCraft repository (https://github.com/storytold/artcraft) ships files that are not
covered by its license and are owned by third parties. None of it may be imported into
White Office:

  - public/resources/sound/          sound effects from Nintendo games
  - public/resources/memes/          meme images and likenesses
  - public/resources/skybox/         third-party skybox textures
  - public/resources/pose/           third-party MMD motion data
  - public/resources/characters_gif/ renders of Mixamo animations
